#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->enable-wrap-around->description
msgid "Wrap around to the opposite edge when no window is found"
msgstr ""

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->enable-wrap-around->tooltip
msgid ""
"When enabled, if there is no window in the selected direction, focus will "
"wrap around to the window on the opposite edge of the screen (e.g., pressing "
"left with no windows to the left will focus the rightmost window)"
msgstr ""
